            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Thien Huong",
            "review_text": "Karen T\nGroningen, The Netherlands42 contributions\n0\nKeep Coming Back\nDec 2018 • Family\nI love this place. Whenever I visit Saigon I have to stop by here at least once. I like the banh cuon with the egg while my parents prefer the original one. The fish sauce was also really tasty and it didn't have a strong smell. This is a typical Vietnamese restaurant so don't expect anything from the service and you'll be fine. Highly recommend if you're a fan of banh cuon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 25, 2018",
