            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Thien Huong",
            "review_text": "Myan\nLos Angeles, California28 contributions\n0\nYummy Banh Cuon!\nDec 2018 • Family\nCame here for breakfast right before our Cu Chi Tunnels tour. My family took me. Recommended this as one of the best places in Saigon. Oh my god, so delicious! We ordered the Banh Cuon (filled with ground pork and mushrooms) with Cha (a type of ham) and veggies. We ordered a few sides of fried shrimp pastry (Banh chien). The fish sauce was delightful. I recommend dipping the Banh Cuon instead of pouring it over. So glad we went here. We got to try something local and true to Saigon.\nRead more\nWritten December 24, 2018",
